# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# lua-odin .gitignore
#
# The rule of thumb here: we track SOURCE and SCRIPTS, never build ARTIFACTS.
# Everything the compiler or a build script spits out lives under build/out or
# is a stray binary next to the source, and none of that belongs in history.
# We also sweep up the usual OS/editor junk so no one accidentally commits it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Our own build output ---------------------------------------------------
# The build/ directory is where we drop compiled binaries and intermediates.
# We keep the scripts (build/*.ps1, build/*.sh) but ignore everything they emit.
/build/out/
/build/**/*.exe
/build/**/*.pdb

# --- Compiled Odin / native artifacts anywhere in the tree ------------------
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# --- Standalone binaries built at the repo root -----------------------------
# Our own `lua` and `luac` (and the classic luac.out dump) if built in place.
/lua
/luac
luac.out

# --- Reference Lua build artifacts under lua/ -------------------------------
# We keep the pristine reference C SOURCE, but its Makefile produces objects and
# binaries we never want to track. These are used only for differential testing.
/lua/src/lua
/lua/src/luac
/lua/src/liblua.a
/lua/src/*.o

# --- Odin-native dynamic modules built for `require` testing ----------------
# Our package library loads Odin-built shared modules (a documented deviation
# from reference Lua's C modules); those compiled modules are artifacts too.
/tests/**/*.dll
/tests/**/*.so
/tests/**/*.dylib

# --- OS junk ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Editor / IDE junk ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace

# --- Ols (Odin language server) local cache ---------------------------------
.ols-cache/
